    figureNameAr: "ذو الكفل",
    honorific: "peace be upon him",
    honorificAr: "عليه السلام",
    summary: "Dhul-Kifl is mentioned in the Quran among the patient and the righteous. Ibn Kathir relates reports that he was a just man—or a prophet—who pledged to fast by day, pray by night, and judge fairly…",
    content: "A Pledge Kept\n\nDhul-Kifl is mentioned in the Quran among the patient and the righteous. Ibn Kathir relates reports that he was a just man—or a prophet—who pledged to fast by day, pray by night, and judge fairly among people without anger. He kept his pledge despite attempts to provoke him. His mention teaches reliability: leadership is proven by self-control, prayer, and justice when people try to make the judge impatient.",
    contentAr: "ذُكر ذو الكفل مع الصابرين والصالحين. وعدّه ابن كثير فيمن ثبتوا على الطاعة والعدل. ومع قلّة التفصيل ففي ذكره عبرة في حفظ الأمانة. والمقصود ليس طول الرواية بل الثبات على أمر الله.",
    durationLabel: "2:00",
    durationMs: 120000,
    authenticityGrade: "sahih",
    sourceCitation: "Ibn Kathir, Stories of the Prophets (Qisas al-Anbiya); teaching paraphrase from the English edition",
    hasAudio: false,
    audioUrl: "https://cdn.storiesofislam.example/audio/qisas/dhul-kifl-among-the-patient.mp3",
    timedCues: [{"startMs": 0, "endMs": 40000, "textEn": "A Pledge Kept", "textAr": ""}, {"startMs": 40000, "endMs": 80000, "textEn": "Dhul-Kifl is mentioned in the Quran among the patient and the righteous. Ibn Kathir relates reports that he was a just man—or a prophet—who pledged to fast by day, pray by night, and judge fairly among people without anger.", "textAr": ""}, {"startMs": 80000, "endMs": 120000, "textEn": "He kept his pledge despite attempts to provoke him. His mention teaches reliability: leadership is proven by self-control, prayer, and justice when people try to make the judge impatient.", "textAr": ""}],
    isFavorite: false,
